The coldblooded **Venomous Killer** lies hidden, waiting to strike
when you least expect it. Whether it's a legless serpent or a huge
lizard, it's not something you want to meet up close. *Art of
Invisibility +2, Attack (Bite) +2 [Perks: Continued Effect x2; Flaws:
Feather Blow, Low Penetration x2; 5 Endurance], Quick +1;
Vulnerability (Heat/Cold) −2.*

